  "duration": 69.53333333333333,
  "text": "You know Jarvis from Iron Man? Tony Stark could ask Jarvis for anything, and it understood how to execute on it the right way. That is the dream for how AI would help us too, but I kept wasting hours re-explaining my business to my AI. So I built a system that remembers every past decision. It understands the priorities of my business, and it keeps all my knowledge organized and easily retrieved. Jarvis worked so well because it had full context. It understood how everything in Tony's life and business were connected. It knew its own capabilities versus when another tool or another person was needed, and it ran core processes automatically on a set cadence to surface needs or issues proactively. And those are the four Cs that I built my AI OS around. So think Jarvis, just without the actual suit. And I'm giving you everything you need to create your own Jarvis for completely free. A simple guided setup process to give it the context that it needs, six skills that will automatically organize all knowledge, create plans of action, and continuously improve the system over time, and an interactive 3D brain that makes it easy for both you and the AI to find anything that you need. You can install the system into CloudCode or Codex or any other AI agent that you wanna use. So check it out for free right now. The link is below",
